    <string name="found_title">Every date is a quest</string>
    <string name="found_text">You two are a party of heroes. Dates are quests out in the real world: a walk becomes a patrol of the lantern road, a supper becomes a feast at the tavern. The book is your game master — it deals each of you a secret objective, sends wandering encounters, rolls the die of fate and keeps the chronicle of everything you lived through together.</string>
    <string name="found_how">First, the party needs its arms. Each of you will answer five questions alone — where you agree, the shield is one; where you don\'t, it splits and shows both.</string>
